      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Versailles%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "An earlier attempt to incorporate Versailles in 1892 was voided because of a defective petition.",
